<p>NOTE: Noncash charges of $571,000 for the second quarter of 1997 and $876,000 for the six months of 1997, representing the company's charges for the equity losses of Pure Energy Corp, Ontro Inc and Insta-Heat Inc, and amortization of goodwill of $168,000 and $313,000 in connection with acquisitions in 1996, contributed to net losses for the second quarter and six months of 1997.</p>
<p>Interest expenses increased to $433,000 for the second quarter and $3,526,00O for the six months, from zero last year, as a result of lines of credit assumed in the acquisitions, and interest expense incurred on the remaining balance of convertible debentures.</p>
<p>Full company name is L. L. Knickerbocker Co Inc.</p>
